{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/marketing_headings-01.png?t=1743822176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solaro takes you deep inside a mysterious world, full of strange creatures, cryptic puzzles, and relics of an ancient past... How did you wind up in this quiet, forgotten sector of the galaxy, and can you master the necessary skills to chart a path through the darkness and back towards your origins? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/holu.gif?t=1743822176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/marketing_headings-02.png?t=1743822176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore space from a new point of view! Navigate the cosmos by harnessing the natural forces of your environment, like gravity, wind, and magnetic fields. Your powerful protective shell can withstand extreme pressure, temperature, acidity, and other conditions, letting you dive deep into dangerous worlds in search of buried treasures... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/ship.gif?t=1743822176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/marketing_headings-03.png?t=1743822176\" />Solaro's world features cryptic puzzle-solving, fast-paced trial challenges, and quiet, meditative exploration. Navigate a vast open-world in your own style, making discoveries and expanding your skillset at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/marketing_headings-04.png?t=1743822176\" />Solaro's vast world and soundtrack were all created by a single developer over several years. Every fragment of the game has been crafted by hand to create a totally unique and original experience. Solaro was built with the open-source game engine Libgdx.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/marketing_headings-05.png?t=1743822176\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ vibrant alien worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ unique &quot;orbital puzzles&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12+ hours of core gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12+ hours of optional features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ collectibles and achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2.5 hours of original music </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1602740?t=1743822176","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743822176","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/946a695baaecaa7896871f546b1885fb14cec129/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743822176","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/946a695baaecaa7896871f546b1885fb14cec129/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743822176","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2801690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_p